      "title": "Signature requirement communication gaps",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t23",
      "body": "84% of delivery complaints involve missed signatures, with users like tk_2913200 reporting lack of advance notice causing missed deliveries [tk_2913200]. This contributes to the high negative share (0.895) and 75.5% growth in the Late or Lost Deliveries theme [amazon-t23]. Improving proactive signature alerts could reduce frustration and lost packages."
    },
    {
      "title": "Prime speed promises not met",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t6",
      "body": "Prime members cite 88% negative sentiment for delayed 2‑day shipments, as seen in tk_2868365 and tk_2693909 describing 3‑4 day arrivals and missed delivery windows [tk_2868365][tk_2693909]. The Prime Delivery Speed Degradation theme is growing 67.5%, indicating urgent need to align logistics with promised timelines."
    },
    {
      "title": "Refund processing delays erode trust",
      "kind": "pain_point",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t33",
      "body": "Delayed refunds affect 91.5% of related complaints, with multiple users (tk_2830780, tk_2980905, tk_673109) experiencing weeks‑long wait times and inconsistent communication [tk_2830780][tk_2980905][tk_673109]. The 17.6% growth in the Delayed Refunds theme highlights a widening gap in post‑purchase service."
    },
    {
      "title": "Content availability inconsistencies on Prime Video",
      "kind": "emerging",
      "theme_id": "amazon-t8",
      "body": "Users report sudden regional removals and playback issues, such as tk_2925545 and tk_2590176 noting missing seasons and broken \"Watch Next\" functionality [tk_2925545][tk_2590176]. With a 31.6% growth in Prime Video content requests, this signals an emerging dissatisfaction that could impact subscription renewals."
    }
  ]
